{"id":"n24943-1-7","stage":3,"title":"천둥 · 雷","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24943-1-7-1","ko":"아빠가 화날 때 한 번 소리를 지르시면 마치 천둥 소리 같아요.","zh":"爸爸生气的时候大喊一声，听起来就像雷声一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아빠가","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아빠：爸爸；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26148","senseId":"1","lemma":"아빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아빠가","audio":"/audio/b3bf441bc46154068ade.mp3"}},{"text":"화날","meaning":"生气，发火","explanation":"화나다：生气，发火；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"화나다","audio":"/audio/380dff375fc26c29cffe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87582","senseId":"1","lemma":"화나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"화날","audio":"/audio/03ab03707c129bab6fda.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"一、一个（修饰后面的量词或名词）","explanation":"한：一、一个（修饰后面的量词或名词）。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"1","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"번","meaning":"次，遍","explanation":"번：次，遍。","readings":[{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26846","senseId":"2","lemma":"번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"번","audio":"/audio/dfccc17e2997aa8da631.mp3"}},{"text":"소리를","meaning":"嗓音，嗓子，嗓门","explanation":"소리：嗓音，嗓子，嗓门；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"3","lemma":"소리","origin":